# Brand and theme

- Product name is **Navroop**. Default theme is **light** (`ThemeProvider` in `app/providers.tsx`: `defaultTheme="light"`, `enableSystem={false}`).
- Do not flip the default to dark or `system`. Theme toggle may still switch to dark.
- Product chrome: white cards on `background-base`, Inter / Geist, Lucide or existing SVGs (never emoji), 44px minimum controls, visible focus rings.
- Heat/orange (`#FA4500`, `--heat-*`) is the existing accent. Keep it for product chrome; do not restyle generated sites with Navroop chrome.
- Motion: 150–200ms color/opacity/transform only.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<ThemeProvider defaultTheme="dark" enableSystem>

// ✅ GOOD
<ThemeProvider attribute="class" defaultTheme="light" enableSystem={false}>
```
